<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-delphi10000-drosophila-paulistorum-turing-wavelength-s0-model-fidelity> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Drosophila paulistorum Schnakenberg ocellar stripe at 2.4 µm (Pass 2) — Model fidelity to source: 91/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-27"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Schnakenberg kinetics, the periodic 5-point Laplacian, and the linear eigenvalue are implemented directly. D_MAGNITUDE_SCALE = 0.478965 places argmax σ(k) at 2.416 µm (gate ±0.02 µm) with σ(k_c)=3.13. Trace -0.2 and determinant 1 match the Lean theorems. Equal diffusion is linearly stable and numerically decays." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-model-fidelity> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/model/grok-4.7> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/model-fidelity" ;
    pk:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-drosophila-paulistorum-turing-wavelength-s0-model-fidelity-1>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-drosophila-paulistorum-turing-wavelength-s0-model-fidelity-2>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-drosophila-paulistorum-turing-wavelength-s0-model-fidelity-3> ;
    pk:hasScore 9.1e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "faithful" .

<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-delphi10000-drosophila-paulistorum-turing-wavelength-s0-morphometric-validation> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Drosophila paulistorum Schnakenberg ocellar stripe at 2.4 µm (Pass 2) — Morphometric validation: 90/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-27"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Nonlinear FFT versus maximum-growth wavelength: Pearson r=0.989, RMSE=0.064 µm. Nominal refined wavelength 2.417 µm on the 14.502 µm patch. Specimen foreground 0.2995 versus prior 0.22, coherency 0.632 versus prior 0.45, circularity 0.597 versus prior 0.72 (none equal to its reference). Midline peak spacing averages 2.402 µm; two-sample KS against a 4% band around 2.417 µm is 0.50. Orena packing 37 and persimilis packing 48 differ from the decade priors 30 and 40." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-morphometric-validation> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/model/grok-4.7> ;
